gqu(){return"Apply the learned weights"},
gqt(){return"Learned weights applied"},
gqv(){return"Weights come from how well each engine separates your human samples from your AI ones (Cohen's d effect size): the further apart the two groups, and the steadier each group is, the more weight that engine earns. This replaces the hand-set fixed weights so the ensemble fits the kind of text you actually work with."},
