rM(a,b){return"The body carries only "+a+" editing-batch marker(s) for "+b+" words. Writing as you think normally leaves dozens; this much concentration usually means the text went in all at once \u2014 pasted, for instance."},
rN(a,b,c){return""+a+" words against "+b+" minutes of recorded editing works out to "+c+" words per minute, far above what anyone sustains while actually writing."},
