grB(){return"Worth knowing: these records can be wiped or reset \u2014 saving as a new file, converting online, exporting from Google Docs, or copying into a fresh document all zero them out. So a signal here is supporting evidence, never a conclusion on its own; and the absence of one does not prove a person wrote it."},
